### List users
GET {{base_api_url}}/users

### Create user
POST {{base_api_url}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ford",
  "email": "ford@example.com"
}

### Get user by id (replace :id with a real id from the list)
GET {{base_api_url}}/users/:id

### Update user
PUT {{base_api_url}}/users/:id
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ford Updated"
}

### Delete user
DELETE {{base_api_url}}/users/:id

### Create user with invalid body (expect 400)
POST {{base_api_url}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "not-an-email"
}
